     4                              <1> ; FillRect: AX=x BX=y CX=w DX=h, colour in [FillCol]
     5                              <1> FillRect:
     6 000004B4 60                  <1>     pusha
     7 000004B5 06                  <1>     push es
     8 000004B6 FC                  <1>     cld
